    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "25f5ca17e2c0653a68265d886327be2954dce74db1daf1674f67414036d2a8ca",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そう言いながら縦に揺れるシルバさん。\n情報量が多くて呆けてしまったが、ふと我に返った。",
      "jp_sha256": "c2dfbc347d8c2de865a18d53ecc9a6f53c7a0d9c5473bc6feb127a4ffd572c92",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇게 말하며 세로로 흔들리는 실바 씨.\n정보량이 너무 많아 넋을 놓았지만, 문득 정신을 차렸다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 58,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b104154744d51144b11fc2904f12f92c08d5228d8d680ba8178057619eae6262:000002_4479125623223178206:g0:r57",
      "row_index_0based": 57,
      "serialized_row_index": 57,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "そう言いながら縦に揺れるシルバさん。\n情報量が多くて呆けてしまったが、ふと我に返った。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "88c91ebe473b94c51d022bb3e9170b05d9b90406b0cbcb837579c8292fd87533",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいっ！\nなんですかその『おっぱい学』って！？\n僕はアシスタントで何をやらされるんですか！",
      "jp_sha256": "c55f5b78e332dd0be5a50144dc7cf0175327e1ee864d4bf3ba4806953e727817",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "자, 잠깐만요!\n그 ‘가슴학’이라는 게 대체 뭔데요!?\n저는 보조 교사로 뭘 해야 하는 거죠!",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 59,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b104154744d51144b11fc2904f12f92c08d5228d8d680ba8178057619eae6262:000002_4479125623223178206:g0:r58",
      "row_index_0based": 58,
      "serialized_row_index": 58,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいっ！\nなんですかその『おっぱい学』って！？\n僕はアシスタントで何をやらされるんですか！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b59fc0d6eed69e3dc82e98cc95677aaa914ef5bf48c751167b873d25458f1e86",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "む。先生は――『おっぱい学』を――知らないのか。\nそれは――いけないな。勉強――不足だ。",
      "jp_sha256": "192edaf8d491c19842c76a3901e75075f564ad95253cc0e7b135b4589c30da54",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "음. 선생은―― ‘가슴학’을―― 모르는 건가.\n그건―― 안 되겠군. 공부가―― 부족하다.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 62,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
